give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Coriolis\"", "italic": true, "color": "dark_aqua"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Clockmaker", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing how many steps from the Demon to its nearest Minion."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pixie", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 1 in-play Townsfolk. If you were mad that you were this character, you gain their ability when they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Empath", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn how many of your 2 alive neighbors are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Seamstress", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose 2 players (not yourself): you learn if they are the same alignment."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Amnesiac", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know what your ability is. Each day, privately guess what it is: you learn how accurate you are."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Tea Lady", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf both your alive neighbors are good, they can't die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Recluse", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou might register as evil & as a Minion or Demon, even if dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Puzzlemaster", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n1 player is drunk, even if you die. If you guess (once) who it is, learn the Demon player, but guess wrong & get false info."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Devil's Advocate", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a living player (different to last night): if executed tomorrow, they don't die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Marionette", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou think you are a good character, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are. [You neighbor the Demon]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "No Dashii", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Your 2 Townsfolk neighbors are poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Vigormortis", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Minions you kill keep their ability & poison 1 Townsfolk neighbor. [-1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bootlegger", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\nThis script has homebrew characters or rules. (Speak with the Storyteller.)"]],title:"Coriolis Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Coriolis Script", "italic": false, "color": "dark_aqua", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Coriolis\"", "italic": false, "color": "dark_aqua"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]